## System-Wide Impact

- **Interaction graph**: Adds a new entry point (`/health`) used by the container runtime.
- **Error propagation**: Healthcheck failures will trigger container restarts by K8s/Docker.
- **Unchanged invariants**: Core security logic, JWT validation, and policy enforcement remain untouched; only the packaging changes.

---

## Risks & Dependencies

| Risk | Mitigation |
|------|------------|
| Libc mismatch (Glibc vs Musl) | Explicitly use `x86_64-linux-musl` target in Docker build stage. |
| Image size bloat | Use multi-stage builds; keep only the binary and certs in runtime image. |
| K8s OOMKilled | Use Prometheus metrics to monitor memory usage and tune limits if needed. |

